    "information": {
      "description": "<p><em>GunMart calls it power armor for large home defense. Its real buyer is a punk with spare cash and a dream of fighting corp suits. The armor is thin and the guns are unreliable, but it's cheap for what it is. A lawsuit from an upset parent means it's now special order only.</em></p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 10,550eb (Luxury)<br><strong>Frame / Shell:</strong> Sigma / Salvaged<br><strong>Stats:</strong> 24 HP • 15 SP • BODY 12 • −1 DEX<br><strong>Onboard weapons:</strong> GunMart HomeSafe w/ Drum Magazine, Grapple Gun Underbarrel &amp; Shotgun Automatic Control Group, GunMart Porta-Morta Plus<br><strong>Onboard cyberware:</strong> Enhanced Holophone, Bodyweight Autoinjector</p><p>One pilot. The suit's stats modify the pilot's; see the Item Compendium, Power Armor.</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Power Armor</small></p>",
